{"4362990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mineheart Abyss", "steam_appid": 4362990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/1897cfc66ef9d3f30f81c57efa60bc29.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mineheart Abyss is an idle/clicker game designed with characters and gameplay in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rock Smashing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break rocks and collect Ore in Mineheart Abyss to craft and level up your equipment. Click on rocks to damage them until they break open. You can also unleash a powerful charged attack or a consistent flurry of idle attacks via your Jackhammer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/212555337491e0fefc75f57125dfe643.poster.avif?t=1777400925\" width=750 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/212555337491e0fefc75f57125dfe643.webm?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/212555337491e0fefc75f57125dfe643.mp4?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cutscenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Achievement in Mineheart Abyss will have a coinciding cutscene that will elaborate on the overall narrative and adventures of Sapphire and Tippy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/18150856331fd9e3e8f28cacea91dcb4.poster.avif?t=1777400925\" width=686 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/18150856331fd9e3e8f28cacea91dcb4.webm?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/18150856331fd9e3e8f28cacea91dcb4.mp4?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend a Mole Girl</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early on in your adventure, Tippy will appear and dig around for helpful “shinies” like Gems. Use these gems to power yourself up and craft even stronger equipment! More helpful girls will appear in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend deeper into the caves with limited resources! Stuff as much as you can into your Satchel and then ride the minecart further down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/f5fbbb781d60c164de6543add34a660c.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to grow stronger and more independent as you blast your way deeper into the caves. Collecting achievements will also provide a permanent boost of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/8b30f078115c3e38fa72c496f7aa5bdd.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resurfacing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the surface to spend your Tippy Tokens that you found during your adventure. You will gain 1 token at Floor 10, and can Resurface at Floor 19. Character Upgrades are permanent and will be balanced over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Panning for Gold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you discover the River, you will place a net in it to passively collect Ore Dust and Coal Dust to increase your haul even further. If your Smelter overheats, throw a bucket of water onto it to make sure it’s as efficient as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/b8468e45e87eae637eac8ac5601daecd.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Lanterns and place them on the map to reveal new Ores to smash, a river to pan at, and eventually a way deeper into the mine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/95eb0c3caf6c1643e9ec43c52a6c389c.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/1897cfc66ef9d3f30f81c57efa60bc29.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mineheart Abyss is an idle/clicker game designed with characters and gameplay in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rock Smashing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break rocks and collect Ore in Mineheart Abyss to craft and level up your equipment. Click on rocks to damage them until they break open. You can also unleash a powerful charged attack or a consistent flurry of idle attacks via your Jackhammer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/212555337491e0fefc75f57125dfe643.poster.avif?t=1777400925\" width=750 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/212555337491e0fefc75f57125dfe643.webm?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/212555337491e0fefc75f57125dfe643.mp4?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cutscenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Achievement in Mineheart Abyss will have a coinciding cutscene that will elaborate on the overall narrative and adventures of Sapphire and Tippy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/18150856331fd9e3e8f28cacea91dcb4.poster.avif?t=1777400925\" width=686 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/18150856331fd9e3e8f28cacea91dcb4.webm?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/18150856331fd9e3e8f28cacea91dcb4.mp4?t=1777400925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend a Mole Girl</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early on in your adventure, Tippy will appear and dig around for helpful “shinies” like Gems. Use these gems to power yourself up and craft even stronger equipment! More helpful girls will appear in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend deeper into the caves with limited resources! Stuff as much as you can into your Satchel and then ride the minecart further down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/f5fbbb781d60c164de6543add34a660c.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrading</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to grow stronger and more independent as you blast your way deeper into the caves. Collecting achievements will also provide a permanent boost of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/8b30f078115c3e38fa72c496f7aa5bdd.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resurfacing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the surface to spend your Tippy Tokens that you found during your adventure. You will gain 1 token at Floor 10, and can Resurface at Floor 19. Character Upgrades are permanent and will be balanced over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Panning for Gold</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you discover the River, you will place a net in it to passively collect Ore Dust and Coal Dust to increase your haul even further. If your Smelter overheats, throw a bucket of water onto it to make sure it’s as efficient as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/b8468e45e87eae637eac8ac5601daecd.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Lanterns and place them on the map to reveal new Ores to smash, a river to pan at, and eventually a way deeper into the mine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/extras/95eb0c3caf6c1643e9ec43c52a6c389c.avif?t=1777400925\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Mineheart Abyss is an idle/clicker game designed with characters and gameplay in mind.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/5c2f2201b639aeb0d822c8ab0bec0448003d9cbe/header.jpg?t=1777400925", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/daff037456a01178c705820b70fad82b5953e030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777400925", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/daff037456a01178c705820b70fad82b5953e030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777400925", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD 630 / AMD Radeon Vega 8<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Arcane Pengi"], "publishers": ["Arcane Pengi"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 35, "description": "In-App Purchases"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/a052fd224dd219f32e5d5517a64b22acd8e89091/ss_a052fd224dd219f32e5d5517a64b22acd8e89091.600x338.jpg?t=1777400925", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362990/a052fd224dd219f32e5d5517a64b22acd8e89091/s